<title>UK: BT, MCI create new web service.</title>
<headline>BT, MCI create new web service.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Telecommunications and MCI, announced on Tuesday the creation of a new global web hosting service which would be offered through their joint venture, Concert Communications Company.</p>
<p>BT and MCI are going through a $20 billion merger plan.</p>
<p>BT said the new offering, Concert Global Web Hosting Service, would speed the flow of information over the internet.</p>
<p>The service would allow businesses to host customer inforamtion on both sides of the Atlantic, easing network congestion.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
